waifu2x_art_noise3_scale.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20230228174142","caption":"たまごっち! vol 20 hoofdstuk 4 2-9 screenshot waifu2x art noise3 scale.png","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/b/b1/%E3%81%9F%E3%81%BE%E3%81%94%E3%81%A3%E3%81%A1%21_vol_20_hoofdstuk_4_2-9_screenshot_waifu2x_art_noise3_scale.png/revision/latest?cb=20230228174142"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Anigif4.gif","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/2/25/Anigif4.gif/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20210530074007","caption":"Anigif4.gif","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/2/25/Anigif4.gif/revision/latest?cb=20210530074007"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Bandicam_2018-03-13_18-05-31-755.jpg","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/8/87/Bandicam_2018-03-13_18-05-31-755.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20180513224950","caption":"Bandicam 2018-03-13 18-05-31-755.jpg","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/8/87/Bandicam_2018-03-13_18-05-31-755.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20180513224950"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Tv1300097713684.jpg","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/a/a2/Tv1300097713684.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20110724020416","caption":"Tv1300097713684.jpg","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/a/a2/Tv1300097713684.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20110724020416"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Bandicam_2018-03-13_18-21-36-080.jpg","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/f/f0/Bandicam_2018-03-13_18-21-36-080.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20181125150325","caption":"Bandicam 2018-03-13 18-21-36-080.jpg","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/f/f0/Bandicam_2018-03-13_18-21-36-080.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20181125150325"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:1418164_original.jpg","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/a/a7/1418164_original.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20141130204337","caption":"1418164 original.jpg","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/a/a7/1418164_original.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20141130204337"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:1598802_original.jpg","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/f/ff/1598802_original.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20141130204442","caption":"1598802 original.jpg","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/f/ff/1598802_original.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20141130204442"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:1599534_original.jpg","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/8/87/1599534_original.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20141130204506","caption":"1599534 original.jpg","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/8/87/1599534_original.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20141130204506"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:1600078_original.jpg","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/8/83/1600078_original.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20141130204520","caption":"1600078 original.jpg","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/8/83/1600078_original.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20141130204520"}],"related":[{"id":"tamagotchi-uni-52d523","title":"Tamagotchi Uni","ru":"Tamagotchi Uni","kind":"device","note":"гость (NPC)"},{"id":"tamagotchi-id-l-06561f","title":"Tamagotchi iD L","ru":"Tamagotchi iD L","kind":"device","note":""}]}